      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the tone. To make it even more effective for the debate, can you expand on the specific \"differences\" the administrator would see? Like, maybe incorporate some of the actual reasoning used at the time regarding the intellectual or social capacities of the local populations compared to Europeans? It helps the students see just how much they believed in those hierarchies.",
